{"id":"informacio_n","lemma":"información","pos":"noun","rank":450,"glosses":["information, data"],"ipa":"/infoɾmaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"informaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-informaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Quiero algo de información.","en":"I want some information.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/76922"},{"text":"¿Esta información es correcta?","en":"Is this information right?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38809"},{"text":"No tengo esa información.","en":"I don't have that information.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594676"},{"text":"Tenemos que reunir información.","en":"We have to gather information.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734441"},{"text":"Tengo información para ti.","en":"I have some information for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450811"}]}